scenario: readonly-report-poison
A         setReadOnly(true), setAutoCommit(false), report query                                        0
A         commit(), then getSchema() for a log line                                                    public
A         close()                                                                                      threw SQLException SQLSTATE 25001: Cannot change transaction read-only property in the middle of a transaction.
observer  pool backend after A's close()                                                               no backend
B         same physical session as A                                                                   false
B         getAutoCommit() | isReadOnly() through the pool                                              true | false
B         insert (expects the pool default, autocommit)                                                ok
observer  where B's insert is visible                                                                  public/ssc_app
B         close()                                                                                      returned normally
observer  pool backend after B's close()                                                               state=idle xact_open=false xid=false xmin=false
C         same physical session as A                                                                   false
C         getAutoCommit() | isReadOnly() through the pool                                              true | false
C         insert (expects the pool default, autocommit)                                                ok
observer  where C's insert is visible                                                                  public/ssc_app
C         close()                                                                                      returned normally
observer  pool backend after C's close()                                                               state=idle xact_open=false xid=false xmin=false
D         same physical session as A                                                                   false
D         getAutoCommit() | isReadOnly() through the pool                                              true | false
D         insert (expects the pool default, autocommit)                                                ok
observer  where D's insert is visible                                                                  public/ssc_app
D         close()                                                                                      returned normally
observer  pool backend after D's close()                                                               state=idle xact_open=false xid=false xmin=false
